        "cooked": "<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1><strong><em>Happy Halloween, y'all</em></strong></h1>\n<p>Figure it would be nice to have a thread to spread well wishes for the Spooky Day. Have yourself some fun, but remember to stay safe. Especially if you've got little ones about.</p>\n<p>Here's some spooky video treats for you:</p>\n<p><em>Mr Poofers Must Die!: </em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f7wstO5elGo\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f7wstO5elGo</a></p>\n<p><em>It's Spooky Month: </em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PmzwhVE5Ly4\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PmzwhVE5Ly4</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Edit: Fixed links</p>",
